Rule 62 (ndim of kernel_size, stride, padding, and dilation must be consistent)
{kernel_size : int ⊎ tuple(int), stride : int ⊎ tuple(int), padding : int ⊎ tuple(int), dilation : int ⊎ tuple(int)} |= if ndim(kernel_size) = 1 then (ndim(stride) = 1 ∧ ndim(padding) = 1 ∧ ndim(dilation) = 1) else (ndim(kernel_size) = ndim(stride) ∧ ndim(kernel_size) = ndim(padding) ∧ ndim(kernel_size) = ndim(dilation))
>>
